ions\n698\t\n699\t| ID | Decision | Status |\n700\t|---|---|---|\n701\t| D1 | Adapters: ILASP / FastLAS, Boolean rule sets, AMIE-style miner, LLM proposer | **owner-selected 2026-10-27 (o)**: \"ILASP / FastLAS (ASP),Boolean rule sets,AMIE-style miner,LLM proposer\". Leaving neural learners out is proposed (p1) |\n702\t| D2 | Live runs: one recorded run per adapter, Popper included, under IL-R2's scratch-prefix and per-gate download rules | **owner-answered 2026-10-27 (o)**: \"Yes, one recorded run each\"; scope confirmed: \"D2 yes (scratch prefix, downloads approved per gate)\" (p1) |\n703\t| D3 | Who runs a learner? (a) keep IK5-D12: evidence scripts only, no GND command; (b) add `gnd learn --target T`. (a) costs nothing; (b) makes GND a learner launcher | proposed (a) |\n704\t| D4 | Adapter order: IL2, IL5, IL3, IL4, run serially. Cost: only sequencing | proposed |\n705\t| D5 | Plan review instrument | **owner-selected 2026-10-27 (o)**: four local reviewer agents (p1) |\n706\t| D6 | Milestone name `ilp-learners`, phase prefix `IL` | proposed |\n707\t| D7 | IK4Q2-D3, the reference-bearing ILP export: in IL1, or kept out | proposed out |\n708\t| D8 (p1) | The IL5 live run: agent adapter and model id; credential source, imported by name from the documented trusted environment and never printed; call or cost ceiling; prompt input limited to the synthetic IK6 export; the provider's terms on output | **owner-ruled 2026-10-27 (o)**: \"D8 at the IL5 gate\"; open until then, and IL5-C3 is blocked |\n709\t| D9 (p1) | New targets widen the two closed `target` enums | **owner-ruled 2026-10-27 (o)**: \"widen within /1\" |\n710\t| D10 (p1) | Admission granularity for the new adapters | **owner-ruled 2026-10-27 (o)**: \"all-or-nothing\" |\n711\t| D11 (p1) | IL4: which mined rules are admitted | **owner-ruled 2026-10-27 (o)**: \"holds only\" |\n712\t| D12 (p1) | A `type-confused-join` check in the shared rewriter, for every target | **owner-ruled 2026-10-27 (o)**: \"add the join 